---
description: Vitest, RTL, Playwright conventions
globs: ["**/*.test.ts", "**/*.test.tsx", "tests/**/*"]
---
- RTL: query by role/label/text; assert user-visible behavior; user-event for interactions.
- MSW for network mocks; vi.useFakeTimers for time. No snapshot-only tests.
- Playwright: getByRole locators, web-first assertions, no waitForTimeout.
